            "claim": {
              "en": "Rajagriha's position inside a defensible ring of hills, near iron-bearing upland terrain and on the routes between the Ganga plain and the peninsular uplands, gave the early Magadhan rulers a strategic base from which to expand."
            },
            "claimStrength": "plausible-influence",
